                          View "public.monthly_sales"
   Column    |  Type  | Collation | Nullable | Default | Storage  | Description 
-------------+--------+-----------+----------+---------+----------+-------------
 sales_month | text   |           |          |         | extended | 
 order_count | bigint |           |          |         | plain    | 
 revenue     | bigint |           |          |         | plain    | 
 units_sold  | bigint |           |          |         | plain    | 
View definition:
 SELECT to_char(orders.order_date::timestamp with time zone, 'YYYY-MM'::text) AS sales_month,
    count(DISTINCT orders.order_id) AS order_count,
    sum(order_items.unit_price * order_items.quantity) AS revenue,
    sum(order_items.quantity) AS units_sold
   FROM orders
     JOIN order_items ON orders.order_id = order_items.order_id
  WHERE orders.status <> '취소'::text
  GROUP BY (to_char(orders.order_date::timestamp with time zone, 'YYYY-MM'::text));
[exit 0]